// DataOps_MLOps_Flow — Arsitektur Layanan Terintegrasi (Sasaran, Tanpa Alat)
// Render manual: https://app.eraser.io > Diagram-as-code (cloud architecture).
//   Buat kanvas BARU bernama "DataOps_MLOps_Flow" (judul kanvas = nama berkas;
//   sintaks cloud architecture tidak mendukung baris title, jadi judul diatur
//   lewat nama kanvas). Jangan menimpa kanvas lama berjudul lain.
// Ekspor PNG ke materials/reports/figures/DataOps_MLOps_Flow.png
// Acuan: Gambar IV.1 (fig:integrate-service), ditempatkan pada Subbab IV.1
//   (sec:layanan-industri) setelah klasifikasi sembilan layer platform dan
//   sebelum pemilihan alat pada Subbab IV.2 (sec:pemilihan-tools). Rincian
//   beralat tiap layer digambar pada kesepuluh berkas Layer_*.eraser
//   (Subbab IV.3, sec:arsitektur-terintegrasi).
// Diagram ini menampilkan LAYANAN saja: sembilan layer platform sebagai kotak
//   grup dengan komponen mayoritasnya sebagai node dalam, TANPA menamai alat
//   atau komponen platform/components/ mana pun (aturan bebas-tool), agar
//   sasaran integrasi terbaca sebelum pemilihan alat dilakukan.
// Ikon: SETIAP node membawa icon generik (bukan logo produk, karena bebas-tool);
//   seluruh nama icon diverifikasi terhadap daftar resmi
//   docs.eraser.io/docs/icons (diperiksa 2026-07-11).
// Konektor: panah > untuk alur berarah faktual, <> untuk hubungan dua arah,
//   -- (garis putus) hanya untuk asosiasi non-alur (payung control plane).
// Rendering WAJIB horizontal (direction right), dua band mendatar. Disertakan
//   tanpa \rotatebox pada LaTeX.
// Sumber komponen tiap kelompok: Tabel layanan_industri (tab:layanan_industri),
//   nama komponen verbatim dari baris tabel tersebut. Pengecualian baris 9
//   (Platform Security, berfrasa Indonesia pada tabel): "akses terkendali" =
//   node "controlled access", "kepatuhan privasi dan keamanan data" = node
//   "privacy and security compliance" (label English mengikuti register round 8).
//   Arah edge intra-kelompok mengikuti urutan tahap pada sumbernya
//   (amershi2019software, munappy2020adhoc, kreuzberger2023mlops,
//   googlecloud2024mlops, najafabadi2024analysis).
// Landasan kematangan (Subbab II.1.2, subsec:maturity):
// - MLOps level 2 (googlecloud2024mlops) + tahap DataOps (munappy2020adhoc).
// Grup "Pemetaan Kematangan Target" merender penanda tersebut pada PNG dan
//   sengaja tanpa edge (legenda, dikecualikan dari aturan konektivitas).

direction right

Sumber Data Eksternal [icon: cloud, color: gray, label: "Sumber Data Eksternal (API, berkas, basis data)"]
Pengguna Platform [icon: users, color: gray, label: "Pengguna Platform (data, model, bisnis)"]

// Band atas: kelompok layanan bidang data
Bidang Data [icon: database, color: blue] {
  Data Ingestion and Processing Layer [icon: download, color: orange] {
    data collection [icon: download]
    data ingestion [icon: inbox]
    data cleaning [icon: filter]
    data preprocessor [icon: cog]
  }
  Data Storage Layer [icon: database, color: green] {
    data storage [icon: database]
    dataset repository [icon: folder]
    data versioning [icon: history]
  }
  Feature Service Layer [icon: package, color: green] {
    offline feature store [icon: package]
    online feature store [icon: zap]
  }
  Data Governance Layer [icon: book, color: teal] {
    data governance [icon: book]
    data testing [icon: check-square]
    data quality [icon: check-circle]
  }
}

// Band bawah: kelompok layanan bidang model dan operasional
Bidang Model dan Operasional [icon: layers, color: purple] {
  Orchestration and Infrastructure Layer [icon: kubernetes, color: blue] {
    infrastructure and supporting services [icon: server]
    workflow orchestration [icon: workflow]
    ML pipeline orchestrator [icon: play]
    model training infrastructure [icon: boxes]
  }
  Model Lifecycle Layer [icon: refresh-cw, color: purple] {
    feature engineering [icon: sliders]
    model training [icon: cpu]
    model evaluation [icon: gauge]
    model registry [icon: archive]
    ML metadata store [icon: database]
    model serving component [icon: send]
    inference service [icon: globe]
  }
  Observability Layer [icon: eye, color: teal] {
    model monitoring [icon: activity]
    data monitoring [icon: eye]
    monitoring component [icon: monitor]
  }
  GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer [icon: git-branch, color: blue] {
    source code repository [icon: git-branch]
    CICD component [icon: repeat, label: "CI/CD component"]
    deployment services [icon: share-2]
    model deployment [icon: upload]
  }
  Platform Security Layer [icon: shield, color: red] {
    API gateway [icon: network]
    controlled access [icon: key]
    privacy and security compliance [icon: scale]
  }
}

// Bidang kendali tunggal (bar tipis di bawah kedua band)
Kubernetes Control Plane [icon: kubernetes, color: gray, label: "Kubernetes Control Plane (satu control plane untuk seluruh kelompok)"]

// Penanda kematangan sasaran, ringkas di ujung kanan (legenda, tanpa edge)
Pemetaan Kematangan Target [icon: check-circle, color: gray] {
  Penanda Target L2 [icon: check-circle, label: "MLOps level 2 (googlecloud2024mlops) + tahap DataOps (munappy2020adhoc)"]
}

// Alur maju antar kelompok layanan (nadi integrasi data ke model)
Sumber Data Eksternal > Data Ingestion and Processing Layer: masuknya data eksternal
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer > Data Storage Layer: data terkelola
Data Ingestion and Processing Layer > Data Governance Layer: validasi kualitas pipeline
Data Storage Layer > Feature Service Layer: sumber fitur
Feature Service Layer > Model Lifecycle Layer: fitur pelatihan dan inferensi
Model Lifecycle Layer > Observability Layer: sinyal pemantauan model
Observability Layer > Model Lifecycle Layer: umpan balik retraining otomatis

// Kelompok operasional menopang alur (edge tingkat kelompok, arah faktual)
Orchestration and Infrastructure Layer > Data Ingestion and Processing Layer: menjadwalkan pipeline data
Orchestration and Infrastructure Layer > Model Lifecycle Layer: menjalankan pipeline ML
GitOps and Continuous Delivery Layer > Model Lifecycle Layer: rilis model dan layanan
Pengguna Platform > Platform Security Layer: akses melalui API gateway

// Satu control plane menaungi kedua band (asosiasi non-alur, garis putus)
Kubernetes Control Plane -- Bidang Data: satu control plane
Kubernetes Control Plane -- Bidang Model dan Operasional: satu control plane

// Konektivitas intra-kelompok: rantai fungsi mengikuti urutan tahap sumbernya.
// Ingestion: collection lalu ingestion (munappy2020adhoc data engineering),
// cleaning lalu preprocessing (amershi2019software, najafabadi2024analysis).
data collection > data ingestion: data mentah terkumpul
data ingestion > data cleaning: pembersihan
data cleaning > data preprocessor: praolah
// Storage: data mendarat di storage, dikurasi ke dataset repository, dan
// versinya dilacak (najafabadi2024analysis, jain2025integrating).
data storage > dataset repository: kurasi dataset
dataset repository > data versioning: riwayat versi
// Feature: offline store dimaterialisasi ke online store (googlecloud2024mlops).
offline feature store > online feature store: materialisasi
// Governance: tata kelola menetapkan standar, pengujian menghasilkan skor
// kualitas (munappy2020adhoc, rella2022mlops).
data governance > data testing: standar pengujian
data testing > data quality: skor kualitas
// Orchestration: infrastruktur menjalankan kedua orkestrator, orkestrator ML
// menjadwalkan pelatihan pada infrastruktur pelatihan (googlecloud2024mlops).
infrastructure and supporting services > workflow orchestration: menjalankan
infrastructure and supporting services > ML pipeline orchestrator: menjalankan
ML pipeline orchestrator > model training infrastructure: menjadwalkan pelatihan
// Lifecycle: tahapan amershi2019software dengan registry dan metadata
// (kreuzberger2023mlops, googlecloud2024mlops).
feature engineering > model training: fitur siap latih
model training > model evaluation: kandidat model
model training > ML metadata store: catatan eksperimen
model evaluation > model registry: model lolos evaluasi
model registry > model serving component: model rilis
model serving component > inference service: endpoint inferensi
// Observability: pemantauan model dan data terkonsolidasi pada monitoring
// component (kreuzberger2023mlops, munappy2020adhoc).
model monitoring > monitoring component: konsolidasi sinyal
data monitoring > monitoring component: konsolidasi sinyal
// GitOps: perubahan kode memicu CI/CD, layanan deployment merilis model
// (kreuzberger2023mlops, googlecloud2024mlops).
source code repository > CICD component: perubahan kode
CICD component > deployment services: artefak teruji
deployment services > model deployment: otomasi rilis
// Security: gerbang API menegakkan akses terkendali di bawah kepatuhan
// (munappy2020adhoc, najafabadi2024analysis).
API gateway > controlled access: autentikasi dan otorisasi
privacy and security compliance > controlled access: kebijakan privasi dan keamanan
